WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.060
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier, and welcome to 'Carrots and Cream.'

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.940
Now this game was recommended to me because,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.100
they said it was bizarre,

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.320
and intriguing, and "right up my alley".

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.180
And when I went to the website all the other reviews said that it was

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.380
"a life changing, mind-blowing experience," and I don't know how true that is,

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:25.960
But let's go, because I hear a pot of- (Chewing noises in-game) Ohhh... Oh God! Aaah... Stop it!

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.200
Ahh it's so gross stop that!

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:32.540
Ewww...?!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.960
I was... I was a bit disturbed by the pot of what I was hoping stew...Oh god..

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.000
And now I'm thinking that it was a pot of boiling blood, probably?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.940
Oh geez... Hi, how's it going? Is that a shovel? I'm gonna assume that's a shovel and I need to...

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.220
Yep, right on target, a little bit off but...

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.460
Oh god...

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.120
Oh god... Ah...

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.200
I mean, it seems like normal, everyday life,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.880
but it's just a slightly perturbing setting, what with the...

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.120
I'm gonna assume it's a river of flowing blood, now.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:04.800
And then the guy that was enjoying carrots and cream

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.120
FAR too much, in the midst of my ear,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.480
And now we're just gonna be picking more carrots so we can do this all over again.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.440
Is this the-...Is this the existential crisis?

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.400
The endless cycle of carrots and cream?

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.620
I don't even wanna know where I get the cream.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:20.260
*Laughing uncomfortably* I don't wanna know where I get the cream...

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.060
Is that gonna be part of this game later?

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.300
Ah shit, I missed!

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.300
There we go!

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.660
That was more on target.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.740
Definitely not cutting my carrot in half.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:31.040
Oh, we're done! Oh, we got enough!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.360
A little garden of five carrots is more than enough...

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.360
Alright... Why are you shaking so much?

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:38.620
I think this guy is shaking from lack of nutrition

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:41.700
from everything else he hasn't had... in his life.

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.140
Oh god.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:47.500
Oh. Well this seems...This seems perfectly normal!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.920
Nothing weird about this!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:52.100
Just chopping carrots into a bowl of what I assume to be cream...

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.960
What type of cream, we aren't going to discuss!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:58.060
But it's a type of cream, while the perpetual...like,

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:02.120
fountain of youth behind me is bubbling furiously away...

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:05.440
And I'm assuming there's a numerous number of dead bodies

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.800
in the closets, and... IN EVERY NOOK AND CRANNY IN THE HOUSE

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:11.640
there's the murdered members of my family, because I'm clearly INSANE.

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.240
Yay!

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.900
This is a game that I- the- i- th- What's weird about it is that it's sooo...

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:18.440
Kinda normal?

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:22.900
And yet it's presented in a way that's VERY disturbing.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.900
Like-- something that-- obviously what I've been doing is I've just been gardening up carrots.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:27.960
And yet...

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:30.560
I am DEEPLY perturbed.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:31.280
Oh hello.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:32.000
Oh.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.000
Is that a worm?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.060
Why is it breathing?

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.200
Why is the ground shaking so much?

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.560
WHY DO WE LIVE IN AN EARTHQUAKE?

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.740
Does it do.. Oh, okay!

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:40.800
Augh!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.740
My- My poor little baby!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:43.640
Oh no!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.060
I didn't know that I was supposed to be racing the gun here.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.580
Okay so I gotta inch my way, I'm assuming...

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.340
I'm assuming this worm is gonna infect- oh no.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:52.840
Oh, this worm is just gonna eat through.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:56.200
I thought, I thought for a second that the worm was gonna infect one of the carrots.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.820
And this this was gonna be the start of the Zombie Apocalypse as this guy

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.460
with his unhealthy obsession with carrots and cream.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:04.880
Decides to accidentally ingest one of these horrible worms.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:06.660
That's getting a little close buddy, you wanna be-

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.760
I don't even think this guy is going for the carrots.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.820
Somehow he has- OOHH!

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.240
He's eaten so many carrots...

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:18.100
He's gained X-Ray vision and he can see through the ground where this worm is.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.800
So he knows and he's trying to stop it from taking all of his crops.

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.140
But you won't stop ME buddy-boo!

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:27.820
I know EXACTLY what I'm doing in my life!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.080
I don't know exactly what I'm doing in this game...

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.460
But I like it! ...  I think?

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.040
I think this is- Oh, hello.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:34.960
Oohh!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.320
Woo! Look at Big Mama Carrot over there!

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:39.800
Ohh hey baby~

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.040
How you doin'?

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.140
Oh boy!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:42.840
My- oh.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.400
Eugh.. I was just..Dangling it with the end of- Oh no..

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.440
OHH!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.480
I was right!!

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:53.260
Oh he's gonna eat this carrot and he's gonna become infested!

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.500
Oh the poor carrot of..

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.060
Like, the GLORIOUS carrot. That's a gigantic carrot.

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:04.060
But I knew that this guy's unholy obsession with these carrots was gonna be the end of him some day.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.000
I mean,

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.900
He may have great vision that can see through the ground,

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:12.740
but he can't see why kids love the taste of Cinnamon Toast Crunch.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.600
Uhhm..

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:15.180
Eugh..

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:18.020
Eugh... Eugh.. Eugh.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:21.020
*Worm Squeaks* OH-HO GOD!

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.200
WHY IS IT SCREAMING?

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:25.840
Oh god!

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.460
Why is there THAT much blood?!

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:32.260
I know this guy's clinically insane but..

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.340
W-Why wouldn't he stop when he sees a fountain of blood?!

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.240
*Boiling Water noise*

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.380
*In-Game sigh*

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.140
DON'T MOAN IN MY EAR!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:44.700
OH THAT'S IT?!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.100
WHAT?!

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:50.300
Huehuewaha?

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.340
It's a- but- THERE'S BLOOD IN THE CREAM!

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.360
Thanks for playing?!

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:01.760
Fuck you for changing my goddamn life!

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.460
What the fuck just happened?

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.040
I don't know..

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.700
I don't know what I accidentally led you guys into!

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.560
I don't know what happened!

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.340
I don't know what to DO with my life now!

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:18.940
I have to go on and play more games today!

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.800
Knowing that this experience befell me.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.320
What? You want an intelligent recap of what just happened?

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.160
YOU WERE THERE!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:29.360
YOU WERE THERE, MAN!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:32.160
You had to experience it WITH me!

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:35.540
It was bizarre because it seems so normal!

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:42.900
And just a few different twists and turns and different sound effects makes it a bizarre and horrifying experience.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.080
But that's 'Carrots and Cream' I guess! So..

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.260
Thank you everybody so much for watching.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.620
As always I'll see you in the next video.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:56.980
Bye bye...

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.120
*Loud squeaky scream sound*

